            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[**Features**
- Added /fork to branch conversations
- Added ⌘↑ and ⌘↓ to navigate between sent messages
- Added a custom processing indicator
- Added diff highlighting for the remote access client

**Fixes**
- Fixed quit confirmation to behave as expected

**Improvements**
- Improved transcript rendering and scroll stability
- Updated code to make use of more native
]]></description>
