            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Changes

- Added remote access through Pangolin with a web chat interface.
- Added configurable timeouts for the shell tool.
- Prevented idle sleep while runs are active.
- Added release notes to the in-app update feed.
]]></description>
