        <item>
            <title>0.1.2</title>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Changes

- Updated the app icon with a solid dark background.
- Deferred Keychain access on fresh installs until a provider is selected.
- Fixed update-badge restoration and click flicker.
- Added compaction activity to the transcript and reset stale context usage after compaction.
- Kept tool rows stable as activity indicators change.
- Added a stopping state while cancellation completes and removed stopped labels from replies.
- Reduced account-allowance refreshes to after runs.
]]></description>
            <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 20:12:53 -0500</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/maxibenner/exec</link>
