        <item>
            <title>0.1.1</title>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Changes

- Added ⌘S to toggle the sidebar.
- Improved chat resizing performance.
- Tool cards now appear as execution starts.
- Chats continue after recoverable tool failures.
- User messages now have blue backgrounds.
- Manually chosen session names are preserved.
]]></description>
